('god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] smb 10.0.0.0/24 -u admin -p ''Passw0rd!''','bash','["Social-Engineer Toolkit (SET)","CrackMapExec","Mimikatz","Responder"]'::jsonb,'["Social-Engineer Toolkit (SET)","CrackMapExec","Mimikatz","Responder"]'::jsonb,1,'CrackMapExec (AD Post-Exploitation): Menguji dan menyebar kredensial di banyak host Active Directory sekaligus untuk memetakan akses.','CrackMapExec (AD Post-Exploitation): Tests and sprays credentials across many Active Directory hosts at once to map access.','Tools ini bernama CrackMapExec, fungsinya: Menguji dan menyebar kredensial di banyak host Active Directory sekaligus untuk memetakan akses.','This tool is called CrackMapExec, and it: Tests and sprays credentials across many Active Directory hosts at once to map access.','Beri rentang IP dan kredensial; tool mengecek mana yang valid di tiap host secara paralel.','Give it an IP range and credentials; it checks which are valid on each host in parallel.','Prinsip ''satu password per sistem'' mencegah satu kredensial bocor membuka seluruh jaringan.','A ''one password per system'' policy stops a single leaked credential from unlocking the whole network.'),
