([TOOL]: listeners) > execute','bash','["BeEF","Empire","Cobalt Strike","Aircrack-ng"]'::jsonb,'["BeEF","Empire","Cobalt Strike","Aircrack-ng"]'::jsonb,1,'Empire (Post-Exploitation C2): Framework command-and-control pasca-eksploitasi berbasis PowerShell/Python untuk persistensi akses.','Empire (Post-Exploitation C2): A PowerShell/Python-based post-exploitation C2 framework for maintaining access persistence.','Tools ini bernama Empire, fungsinya: Framework command-and-control pasca-eksploitasi berbasis PowerShell/Python untuk persistensi akses.','This tool is called Empire, and it: A PowerShell/Python-based post-exploitation C2 framework for maintaining access persistence.','Buat listener, hasilkan stager untuk korban, lalu kendalikan agent yang terhubung.','Create a listener, generate a stager for the victim, then control the connected agent.','EDR (Endpoint Detection & Response) modern dirancang khusus mendeteksi pola agent C2 seperti ini.','Modern EDR (Endpoint Detection & Response) is specifically built to detect C2 agent patterns like this.'),
