(Empire: listeners) > execute','bash','["stagers","modules","agents","listeners"]'::jsonb,'["stagers","modules","agents","listeners"]'::jsonb,3,'Bagian yang hilang adalah "listeners". Buat listener, hasilkan stager untuk korban, lalu kendalikan agent yang terhubung.','The missing part is "listeners". Create a listener, generate a stager for the victim, then control the connected agent.','Empire dipakai untuk: Framework command-and-control pasca-eksploitasi berbasis PowerShell/Python untuk persistensi akses.','Empire is used to: A PowerShell/Python-based post-exploitation C2 framework for maintaining access persistence.','Buat listener, hasilkan stager untuk korban, lalu kendalikan agent yang terhubung.','Create a listener, generate a stager for the victim, then control the connected agent.','EDR (Endpoint Detection & Response) modern dirancang khusus mendeteksi pola agent C2 seperti ini.','Modern EDR (Endpoint Detection & Response) is specifically built to detect C2 agent patterns like this.'),
('god','guess','Apa fungsi dari Empire?','What is Empire used for?','// Empire — Post-Exploitation C2','bash','["Memvisualisasikan hubungan antar data (domain, email, orang) dari sumber OSINT dalam bentuk graf.","Framework command-and-control pasca-eksploitasi berbasis PowerShell/Python untuk persistensi akses.","Platform command-and-control untuk mensimulasikan serangan APT dalam latihan red team.","Mengendalikan browser korban yang sudah ''dikaitkan'' lewat XSS untuk eksplorasi lebih lanjut."]'::jsonb,'["Visualizes relationships between data (domains, emails, people) from OSINT sources as a graph.","A PowerShell/Python-based post-exploitation C2 framework for maintaining access persistence.","A command-and-control platform for simulating APT-style attacks in red team exercises.","Controls a victim''s ''hooked'' browser via XSS for further exploration."]'::jsonb,1,'Empire: Framework command-and-control pasca-eksploitasi berbasis PowerShell/Python untuk persistensi akses.','Empire: A PowerShell/Python-based post-exploitation C2 framework for maintaining access persistence.','Empire adalah kategori "Post-Exploitation C2".','Empire falls under the "Post-Exploitation C2" category.','Buat listener, hasilkan stager untuk korban, lalu kendalikan agent yang terhubung.','Create a listener, generate a stager for the victim, then control the connected agent.','EDR (Endpoint Detection & Response) modern dirancang khusus mendeteksi pola agent C2 seperti ini.','Modern EDR (Endpoint Detection & Response) is specifically built to detect C2 agent patterns like this.');
